.NET Blazor - Complete Summary (Interview Notes)
What is Blazor?

Blazor is Microsoft's modern UI framework for building interactive web applications using C# instead of JavaScript.

Earlier:

Frontend -> HTML + CSS + JavaScript
Backend -> C#

With Blazor:

Frontend -> C#
Backend -> C#

Everything can be written using .NET.

Blazor is built on top of ASP.NET Core.

